      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At home, Nastya's father stuffs a bag with cash for the ransom drop while his wife pleads with him not to take a gun and insists Kostya ride along to keep him from doing anything reckless. Back at the restaurant, Chef Barinov catches Max sneaking in through the back door.",
